  "body": "The API is [shipped](https://www.chromestatus.com/features/5657284784947200) in latest stable Chrome (since M46). The API design\nwas discussed on [WhatWG mailing list](https://lists.w3.org/Archives/Public/public-whatwg-archive/2015Mar/0070.html). The patch does the following:\n- Define [history.scrollRestoration](http://majido.github.io/scroll-restoration-proposal/history-based-api.html) and update relevant IDL\n- Add a new persisted user state restoration algorithm\n\nOnce merge I will close the original [W3C bug](https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=28553).\n",
